META
    esp_id `r9-rhel-09-232250-no-unowned-files-001`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `rocky9`
    criticality `high`

    title `STIG RHEL-09-232250: All RHEL 9 local files and directories must have a valid group owner.`
    description `All RHEL 9 local files and directories must have a valid group owner.`
    author `example-security`
    tags `rhel9,stig,disa-stig,filesystem`

    control_mapping `DISA-STIG:RHEL-09-232250,NIST-800-53:CM-6`
    control_objective `CM-6`

    assessment_method `TEST`
